# q12-fire.script — Q12 event-parity fixture: 'p' fire latch
#
# D16 rows exercised (see test/harness/d16-state-machine.md):
#   - KeyDown 'p': fireThisFrame=on + firing latch=on.
#   - KeyUp 'p': fireThisFrame=off + latch=off.
#   - The autofire path: with ShipBulletGroup::autoFire on, the frame-head
#     latch check fires every frame while the latch is held (hold = stream
#     of bullets at frame rate, NOT per repeat event).
#   - Same-drain cancel (negative): a press+release consumed by ONE drain
#     fires nothing — the down/up pair below at boundaries 200/201 is
#     INTENTIONALLY inside one frame period to encode that contract.
#
# Pass criteria (Q12): identical bullet counts/state at checkpoints across
# backends; the same-drain pair produces zero bullets on every backend.
#
# Run:
#   ./obj/harness --seed 12345 --script test/harness/scripts/q12-fire.script \
#       --out DIR --hiscore test/harness/fixtures/hiScore.nul.data

1    capture q12_help

3    keydown s
6    keyup s
40   capture q12_start

50   keydown p
54   capture q12_fire_first    # single shot in flight
62   keyup p

80   keydown p                 # hold: autofire latch emits per frame
120  keyup p
126  capture q12_fire_volley   # multiple bullets, deterministic count

# negative control: press+release within one drain cancels
200  keydown p
201  keyup p
230  capture q12_no_fire       # must equal q12_fire_volley state + aging only

250  keydown q
254  keyup q
